      "updated": 1788202510505,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Roles: \nknow the other service's shape — what it returns, and as what\nhold something that can make HTTP calls, without making a new one each time\nknow where that service is right now\nturn its response into our types\nhand the result to whoever asked",
      "fontSize": 16,
